  "review": {
    "book": "NUM",
    "entityID": "person:reuben_2429",
    "primaryWitnesses": [
      {
        "ref": "NUM 1:5",
        "textualBasisJa": "These are the names of the men who shall stand with you: Of Reuben: Elizur the son of Shedeur."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 1:20",
        "textualBasisJa": "The children of Reuben, Israel’s firstborn, their generations, by their families, by their fathers’ houses, according to the number of the names, one by one, every male from twenty years old and upward, all who were able to go out to war:"
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 1:21",
        "textualBasisJa": "those who were counted of them, of the tribe of Reuben, were forty-six thousand five hundred."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 2:10",
        "textualBasisJa": "“On the south side shall be the standard of the camp of Reuben according to their divisions. The prince of the children of Reuben shall be Elizur the son of Shedeur."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 2:16",
        "textualBasisJa": "“All who were counted of the camp of Reuben were one hundred fifty-one thousand four hundred fifty, according to their armies. They shall set out second."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 7:30",
        "textualBasisJa": "On the fourth day Elizur the son of Shedeur, prince of the children of Reuben,"
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 10:18",
        "textualBasisJa": "The standard of the camp of Reuben went forward according to their armies. Elizur the son of Shedeur was over his army."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 13:4",
        "textualBasisJa": "These were their names: Of the tribe of Reuben, Shammua the son of Zaccur."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 16:1",
        "textualBasisJa": "Now Korah, the son of Izhar, the son of Kohath, the son of Levi, with Dathan and Abiram, the sons of Eliab, and On, the son of Peleth, sons of Reuben, took some men."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 26:5",
        "textualBasisJa": "Reuben, the firstborn of Israel; the sons of Reuben: of Hanoch, the family of the Hanochites; of Pallu, the family of the Palluites;"
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 32:1",
        "textualBasisJa": "Now the children of Reuben and the children of Gad had a very great multitude of livestock. They saw the land of Jazer, and the land of Gilead. Behold, the place was a place for livestock."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 32:2",
        "textualBasisJa": "Then the children of Gad and the children of Reuben came and spoke to Moses, and to Eleazar the priest, and to the princes of the congregation, saying,"
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 32:6",
        "textualBasisJa": "Moses said to the children of Gad, and to the children of Reuben, “Shall your brothers go to war while you sit here?"
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 32:25",
        "textualBasisJa": "The children of Gad and the children of Reuben spoke to Moses, saying, “Your servants will do as my lord commands."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 32:29",
        "textualBasisJa": "Moses said to them, “If the children of Gad and the children of Reuben will pass with you over the Jordan, every man who is armed to battle before the LORD, and the land is subdued before you, then you shall give them the land of Gilead for a possession;"
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 32:31",
        "textualBasisJa": "The children of Gad and the children of Reuben answered, saying, “As the LORD has said to your servants, so will we do."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 32:33",
        "textualBasisJa": "Moses gave to them, even to the children of Gad, and to the children of Reuben, and to the half-tribe of Manasseh the son of Joseph, the kingdom of Sihon king of the Amorites, and the kingdom of Og king of Bashan; the land, according to its cities and borders, even the cities of the surrounding land."
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 32:37",
        "textualBasisJa": "The children of Reuben built Heshbon, Elealeh, Kiriathaim,"
      },
      {
        "ref": "NUM 34:14",
        "textualBasisJa": "for the tribe of the children of Reuben according to their fathers’ houses, the tribe of the children of Gad according to their fathers’ houses, and the half-tribe of Manasseh have received their inheritance."
      }
    ],
